{
  "name": "Primal Avatar",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits while shifted:</p><ul><li>Your can increase your size to Huge and your Natural Weapons die is tripled for calculating your base weapon damage. If you lack the room to become Huge, your size doesn't change.</li><li>You can't be Charmed or Frightened. If you are Charmed or Frightened when you use Formshift, the effect is suspended for the duration of the shift.</li><li>The healing gained from your Ferocious Vitality feature is increased to 5x your Shifter level.</li></ul>",
